   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The interior of a modern server room in a data center.  An IT engineer is busy configuring the servers. The room is dark, but the servers themselves are lit.  The servers at the left side are lit in blue, while the ones at the other end are lit by an orange light source coming from the right side.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
